From c011ef9e4e0ba4c68e2b40a12032417add44b567 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 00:14:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] TRAYNOPICKUP: HT9050 Tray Arm positions are the teach point +
 Offset (no 6800 pickup), and Color follows the Empty rule -- EastSun 1008 box
 'TrayArm moves 6800 out of the HT9050 order (other)' -> 'use the HT9050 flag;
 the Tray Arm positions must not add 6800'.

cinitial.cpp (Tray Arm Prod block, a blank line): on HT9050 (9050GPIB or Type_HT9050) Prod.iXTrayLoad / Empty / Color / Auto1..6 = Tech teach + Offset.iTrayArmX only (no Load/Empty/Auto form iPickUp, 6800 here); iXTraySafty = Empty teach - 2000. ART positions unchanged. Motor/mymotor.cpp TRAYSAFE9050 line: Color (HT9050 has no Color track; golden waits / clears there) follows the Empty rule instead of [Empty, Loader]. Other machines: golden. Same lines.
tests/test_flow9050_tray.cpp [TS]: + Color beyond Empty moves. Flow9050_Tray 116/116, W6_3_CatchTray, B8_Cl4_StartAutoClean, E023_StatusEvents, S26_R3_InPos passed. Release linked; Debug compiled (link waits for EastSun's program). WORKLOG row 194.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Motor/mymotor.cpp            | 2 +-
 cinitial.cpp                 | 2 +-
 docs/WORKLOG_MACHINE.md      | 1 +
 tests/test_flow9050_tray.cpp | 3 +++
 4 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

